WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.915
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.185 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:34.385 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:42.105 --> 01:43.825
-Hello, sir! -Come and have a look!

5
01:43.905 --> 01:46.145
-That's nice. -Have a look!

6
01:46.225 --> 01:48.465
-I do like the color. -Yes.

7
01:48.545 --> 01:50.665
It looks so nice.

8
01:55.625 --> 01:58.065
Hey, sir. I will have one.

9
01:58.145 --> 02:00.145
Pick me a good one.

10
02:00.225 --> 02:01.465
Of course.

11
02:01.545 --> 02:03.785
Thank you. Take care.

12
02:06.065 --> 02:06.905
Get lost!

13
02:13.785 --> 02:15.545
The world can change in an instant.

14
02:15.625 --> 02:17.065
Once, deadly foes.

15
02:17.145 --> 02:18.305
Hereafter, we are of one aim.

16
02:19.025 --> 02:22.185
Even bitter enemies can become allies.

17
02:26.585 --> 02:29.025
Since when does a snake have good intentions?

18
02:30.545 --> 02:33.945
General Qi, you care nothing for wealth or power.

19
02:34.465 --> 02:36.545
The only thing you desire is her.

20
02:37.345 --> 02:39.425
You know she's your buddy's wife,

21
02:39.505 --> 02:41.865
yet you can't stay away from her.

22
02:42.945 --> 02:45.945
Why? You simply can't help yourself.

23
02:47.265 --> 02:49.665
You know exactly what I mean.

24
02:50.745 --> 02:52.505
Who do you think you are?

25
02:53.225 --> 02:54.465
You think you can read my mind?

26
02:55.145 --> 02:57.305
Because I was on the city wall that day, too.

27
02:58.705 --> 03:00.945
Such breathtaking beauty…

28
03:01.025 --> 03:02.385
HENGCHENG GATE

29
03:02.465 --> 03:03.785
Brighter than gold or jewels.

30
03:03.865 --> 03:06.025
More tempting than power itself.

31
03:06.105 --> 03:08.305
Enough to make a man's very soul tremble.

32
03:09.065 --> 03:10.345
Qi Zhongkai.

33
03:11.105 --> 03:14.145
No one in this world understands you better than I do.

34
03:21.745 --> 03:25.545
Everything in this world has its price.

35
03:27.185 --> 03:30.705
If a deal falls through, it's just that the offer wasn't sweet enough.

36
03:31.425 --> 03:33.225
Well, General Qi?

37
03:34.505 --> 03:37.025
I wonder if Noble Lady Wu'an

38
03:39.185 --> 03:41.225
is tempting enough for you.

39
04:11.825 --> 04:14.425
ZHAOYANG PALACE

40
04:17.145 --> 04:19.384
Your Majesty, those elixirs are poisoning you.

41
04:22.865 --> 04:24.385
You're worrying over nothing.

42
04:26.345 --> 04:27.385
Brother!

43
04:27.465 --> 04:29.225
-Don't stop me! -Brother!

44
04:29.305 --> 04:31.425
-I need to see Father! -It hasn't been verified yet.

45
04:31.505 --> 04:33.745
Keep it down. Don't sully the Crown Prince's reputation.

46
04:33.825 --> 04:35.025
Father!

47
04:35.105 --> 04:36.785
What's with all this pushing and pulling?

48
04:36.865 --> 04:38.225
Have you no sense of decorum?

49
04:40.865 --> 04:41.945
Your Majesty's health is at stake.

50
04:42.545 --> 04:43.865
I was beside myself with worry.

51
04:43.945 --> 04:45.905
Forgive my disrespect, Father.

52
04:46.505 --> 04:47.425
Father.

53
04:47.985 --> 04:49.985
A palace maid from Furong Hall has reported

54
04:50.065 --> 04:52.865
that Lady Zheng replaced Solomon's seal

55
04:53.385 --> 04:54.825
with poisonous gelsemium in the ginseng soup.

56
04:58.105 --> 04:59.465
What's gelsemium?

57
04:59.545 --> 05:02.385
Gelsemium is also called poison root.

58
05:02.465 --> 05:04.145
They look the same.

59
05:04.225 --> 05:06.065
But Solomon's seal nourishes, while gelsemium is poisonous.

60
05:06.145 --> 05:08.105
It's especially deadly with cinnabar.

61
05:08.185 --> 05:10.065
Father's been taking cinnabar elixirs for years.

62
05:10.585 --> 05:12.465
The ginseng soup makes the poison stronger.

63
05:12.985 --> 05:15.985
Within days, you'll bleed from every orifice.

64
05:16.705 --> 05:18.505
And no medicine can save you!

65
05:20.425 --> 05:22.905
Your Majesty, this ginseng soup

66
05:23.505 --> 05:25.625
strengthens the body and restores vitality.

67
05:26.465 --> 05:29.185
You really should drink more of it.

68
05:37.465 --> 05:39.425
The medicinal smell is too strong.

69
05:39.505 --> 05:40.705
I simply can't get used to it.

70
05:55.225 --> 05:58.345
Father! I truly knew nothing about this!

71
05:58.425 --> 06:00.065
Please believe me, Father!

72
06:00.665 --> 06:01.745
Your Majesty!

73
06:01.825 --> 06:04.145
These accusations are lies!

74
06:04.665 --> 06:06.945
Prince Fu resents my son becoming Crown Prince.

75
06:07.025 --> 06:10.225
He's been plotting to frame him!

76
06:10.985 --> 06:13.425
Which wretched maid in my palace accused me?

77
06:13.505 --> 06:15.585
Does she dare confront me face-to-face?

78
06:25.745 --> 06:26.705
Your Highness.

79
06:26.785 --> 06:27.945
His Majesty is rewarding you

80
06:28.025 --> 06:30.345
with Solomon's seal ginseng soup and a golden elixir.

81
07:10.945 --> 07:13.305
Your Majesty, don't make things hard for Shou.

82
07:13.865 --> 07:17.505
He's always been your favorite son.

83
07:20.505 --> 07:22.385
He may have his faults,

84
07:24.225 --> 07:27.465
but they're merely romantic indiscretions.

85
07:28.225 --> 07:31.025
He'd never risk his life over them.

86
07:31.785 --> 07:33.465
This is all my fault.

87
07:34.225 --> 07:37.785
I couldn't stand watching that woman Zhou Fu grow so arrogant!

88
07:38.305 --> 07:40.145
She's nothing but a lowly wet nurse's daughter,

89
07:40.225 --> 07:42.545
yet she dared claim equal standing with me,

90
07:42.625 --> 07:44.305
the daughter of a Grand Commandant!

91
07:46.185 --> 07:49.105
I was humiliated in public before,

92
07:49.185 --> 07:51.465
and Your Majesty believed only her side.

93
07:52.145 --> 07:56.985
I was mistreated and humiliated!

94
07:58.225 --> 08:01.705
How could I possibly bear it, Your Majesty?

95
08:21.265 --> 08:24.425
Your Majesty. What has Shou done to deserve this?

96
08:25.065 --> 08:28.185
Prince Fu is trying to frame the Crown Prince.

97
08:28.265 --> 08:31.665
He wants to take his place, Your Majesty!

98
08:32.505 --> 08:36.105
Are you really going to have another son killed?

99
08:36.185 --> 08:37.144
Your Majesty!

100
08:38.545 --> 08:40.904
Father, I'm innocent!

101
08:40.985 --> 08:44.264
I've been falsely accused! I'm innocent!

102
08:44.345 --> 08:45.545
Father!

103
08:46.825 --> 08:49.825
-What has Shou done wrong? -I'm innocent!

104
08:52.225 --> 08:54.265
-What has Shou done wrong? -Guards!

105
08:57.825 --> 09:01.665
Your Majesty!

106
09:01.745 --> 09:05.265
What has Shou done to deserve this?

107
09:05.345 --> 09:08.425
What has Shou done wrong?

108
09:16.385 --> 09:17.385
Go back.

109
09:20.105 --> 09:21.985
You should be grateful to your mother.

110
09:22.745 --> 09:24.705
She may be foolish and shortsighted,

111
09:26.465 --> 09:28.145
but when your life was on the line,

112
09:29.505 --> 09:31.265
she was willing to die for you.

113
09:32.625 --> 09:33.705
She was right.

114
09:34.745 --> 09:35.585
I…

115
09:36.385 --> 09:38.385
I don't want to lose another son.

116
09:41.225 --> 09:46.025
From now on, know your place and be grateful for what you have.

117
10:00.305 --> 10:02.905
CROWN PRINCE'S RESIDENCE

118
10:04.865 --> 10:06.745
Perhaps tomorrow.

119
10:06.825 --> 10:08.145
Perhaps next month.

120
10:10.745 --> 10:14.105
His Majesty will strip you of your title whenever the mood strikes him.

121
10:15.425 --> 10:20.745
How can a cripple who's lost his favor ever inherit the throne?

122
10:21.745 --> 10:23.145
This is all Wu'an's fault.

123
10:24.985 --> 10:25.985
Your Highness.

124
10:33.945 --> 10:35.865
His Majesty hasn't deposed you, after all.

125
10:36.545 --> 10:38.625
You still have a chance to fight back.

126
10:43.945 --> 10:45.945
Traitors have corrupted the realm.

127
10:46.025 --> 10:47.745
That's why Heaven sent this plague.

128
10:49.625 --> 10:50.825
You're the Crown Prince.

129
10:50.905 --> 10:52.945
You must rid the court of corruption,

130
10:53.025 --> 10:54.785
save the people from suffering,

131
10:54.865 --> 10:56.945
and achieve something truly great.

132
11:00.465 --> 11:01.785
Who are these traitors?

133
11:01.865 --> 11:03.385
Isn't it obvious?

134
11:03.465 --> 11:05.825
Lady Li, of course, and her daughter, Lady Wu'an.

135
11:05.905 --> 11:08.185
They've brought ruin to the realm.

136
11:09.265 --> 11:11.345
If you want to eliminate these traitors,

137
11:12.105 --> 11:14.545
you must get rid of Lu Zhuo first.

138
11:44.825 --> 11:47.145
This is a secret letter from Lord Han.

139
11:52.225 --> 11:55.785
DIMAN, KING OF HUTUO

140
11:56.785 --> 11:59.025
The last time I allied with the Han family,

141
11:59.105 --> 12:01.185
I lost many of my men.

142
12:01.785 --> 12:06.105
So this time, why should I agree?

143
12:08.145 --> 12:09.545
Your Majesty's three defeats

144
12:09.625 --> 12:12.825
were the work of the Lu family, keeping you from Yunzhong and Yanmen.

145
12:12.905 --> 12:14.745
They're your greatest threat.

146
12:15.345 --> 12:17.665
If this plan succeeds, that threat will be gone.

147
12:19.465 --> 12:20.625
Take a look, Your Majesty.

148
12:21.905 --> 12:23.385
Once my master takes power,

149
12:23.465 --> 12:25.385
he is willing to offer Youbeiping Commandery.

150
12:25.465 --> 12:27.945
Lands with plenty of water and grass, where the herds grow fat.

151
12:28.025 --> 12:30.385
Let it be lent to Your Majesty for ten years of grazing.

152
12:37.905 --> 12:41.225
Good. Now that's a fine deal!

153
12:41.305 --> 12:43.425
YANMEN, YUNZHONG, YOUBEIPING

154
12:43.505 --> 12:45.465
Urgent military dispatch!

155
12:45.545 --> 12:46.865
Urgent military dispatch!

156
12:46.945 --> 12:49.585
Make way! Urgent dispatch!

157
12:50.105 --> 12:51.825
Urgent dispatch!

158
12:51.905 --> 12:53.745
ZHAO

159
12:55.705 --> 12:58.305
The Hutuo have terrorized our northern border for decades.

160
12:58.385 --> 12:59.905
Countless people have suffered.

161
12:59.985 --> 13:01.905
I've had enough!

162
13:01.985 --> 13:02.825
Lu Zhuo.

163
13:03.465 --> 13:05.265
I command you to lead our armies

164
13:06.025 --> 13:09.385
north to secure the border and crush the invaders.

165
13:09.985 --> 13:12.865
Do not let me down.

166
13:14.305 --> 13:17.305
I will do everything in my power to secure the border

167
13:17.385 --> 13:18.825
and keep our people safe.

168
13:24.705 --> 13:27.265
The situation is critical.

169
13:27.345 --> 13:29.345
Leave the capital at once. No delays.

170
13:30.625 --> 13:31.705
Yes, Your Majesty.

171
13:32.625 --> 13:34.905
ZHAO

172
13:42.625 --> 13:43.825
Lu Zhuo.

173
13:45.185 --> 13:48.025
I'm entrusting the fate of our dynasty entirely to you.

174
13:48.105 --> 13:49.945
If the situation becomes dire,

175
13:50.465 --> 13:53.905
you have my authority to act as you see fit.

176
13:54.545 --> 13:58.305
I'll give my life if I must to repay Your Majesty's trust.

177
14:02.305 --> 14:03.145
Zhuo.

178
14:03.745 --> 14:05.785
Watch out for those plotting against you.

179
14:08.265 --> 14:11.065
Han Liao is eager to redeem himself and restore his family's honor.

180
14:11.585 --> 14:13.425
He's even willing to serve under you.

181
14:14.625 --> 14:16.145
Why turn him away?

182
14:16.825 --> 14:17.785
Who knows?

183
14:19.025 --> 14:20.385
He might prove quite useful.

184
14:20.465 --> 14:21.825
Useful?

185
14:24.585 --> 14:25.585
Han Liao?

186
14:26.425 --> 14:28.545
Go ahead and enjoy your little triumph.

187
14:28.625 --> 14:33.665
The one who knows you best will be your greatest enemy.

188
14:33.745 --> 14:34.825
I'm off to the battlefield

189
14:34.905 --> 14:36.465
this time to earn the ultimate glory

190
14:37.065 --> 14:38.345
I'll show the world

191
14:38.425 --> 14:40.825
Lu Zhuo isn't the only hero in the Lu family!

192
14:51.105 --> 14:52.745
Your Ladyship, Lord Lu leaves by decree.

193
14:52.825 --> 14:54.025
The situation is urgent.

194
14:54.105 --> 14:55.985
He sent me to apologize for his sudden departure.

195
16:23.385 --> 16:24.305
It's all right.

196
16:24.385 --> 16:25.625
-Forget it. -Go on.

197
16:32.505 --> 16:34.905
Rao. Don't worry.

198
16:34.985 --> 16:36.265
My brother will win.

199
16:36.865 --> 16:38.585
He's never lost a battle in his life.

200
16:43.065 --> 16:43.825
Thank you.

201
16:47.865 --> 16:50.185
Rao. He'll come home safe.

202
16:50.265 --> 16:51.305
Don't worry.

203
17:00.905 --> 17:02.345
He didn't even say goodbye.

204
17:03.465 --> 17:04.625
Like I'm worried about him.

205
17:05.745 --> 17:07.464
I wonder how far the army has gotten.

206
17:08.464 --> 17:09.704
Have they won yet?

207
17:13.025 --> 17:14.025
Get back to work.

208
17:17.464 --> 17:19.184
Like I'm worried about him.

209
17:29.865 --> 17:31.865
The enemy is gathering east of Longcheng.

210
17:33.065 --> 17:34.305
At dawn, three days from now,

211
17:34.385 --> 17:37.505
I'll personally lead our armored cavalry in an assault on their main forces.

212
17:38.185 --> 17:40.025
-Generals of the Left and Right. -Yes, sir!

213
17:40.585 --> 17:43.625
Each of you will lead 10000 cavalry archers to support our flanks.

214
17:43.705 --> 17:44.865
Qi Zhongkai.

215
17:45.425 --> 17:46.865
Take 10000 soldiers upstream

216
17:47.385 --> 17:48.465
and set an ambush.

217
17:49.065 --> 17:50.065
Cut off their retreat to the north.

218
17:51.625 --> 17:52.825
Yes, General!

219
17:57.065 --> 17:59.105
Brother. What about my assignment?

220
17:59.185 --> 18:00.385
Lu Ya.

221
18:01.025 --> 18:03.705
This is a military camp, not a place for you to do as you please.

222
18:03.785 --> 18:06.225
General! Grandfather sent me here to gain experience.

223
18:06.305 --> 18:07.225
But you've given me an empty title!

224
18:07.825 --> 18:08.905
I want to fight. Let me!

225
18:08.985 --> 18:11.825
Lu Ya. Your brother is looking out for you.

226
18:11.905 --> 18:13.305
Never reckless in battles.

227
18:13.385 --> 18:14.225
Go back and cool off.

228
18:14.305 --> 18:16.025
Are you afraid I'll steal your spotlight?

229
18:16.105 --> 18:17.385
Don't touch me!

230
18:21.505 --> 18:23.465
Second Young Master. My Lord!

231
18:26.145 --> 18:28.105
He's young. It's only natural he's hotheaded.

232
18:28.625 --> 18:31.225
After a few battles, once he's faced life and death,

233
18:31.825 --> 18:32.865
he'll learn.

234
18:32.945 --> 18:33.985
Pay him no mind.

235
18:35.865 --> 18:36.905
I need to talk to you.

236
18:36.985 --> 18:39.745
Perfect. I have something to tell you, too.

237
18:40.705 --> 18:42.905
Lu Zhuo is always on guard around me.

238
18:44.425 --> 18:46.865
-I have you to thank for this. -It's the least I could do.

239
18:46.945 --> 18:48.545
-Second Young Master. -Don't follow me!

240
18:50.225 --> 18:51.345
-Second Young Master. -Get lost!

241
18:53.425 --> 18:54.945
You know what to do, right?

242
18:55.025 --> 18:58.225
That arrogant, inexperienced fool can't stand being challenged.

243
18:59.345 --> 19:01.545
Don't worry. With just a few words,

244
19:01.625 --> 19:05.185
I'll turn those brothers against each other.

245
19:07.025 --> 19:09.065
ZHAO

246
19:15.745 --> 19:16.945
A bystander sees it best.

247
19:17.025 --> 19:18.025
I'll go talk to them.

248
19:18.945 --> 19:20.025
Someone! Saddle my horse!

249
19:30.705 --> 19:32.825
Want to know if she truly loves you?

250
19:32.905 --> 19:34.465
Why not putting it to a test?

251
19:39.305 --> 19:43.385
You've seen all my flaws with your own eyes.

252
19:44.145 --> 19:45.585
But for some reason,

253
19:46.345 --> 19:50.025
I want you to remember me as someone a little kinder,

254
19:51.265 --> 19:52.865
someone better.

255
19:57.105 --> 19:58.185
Zhao Song.

256
20:10.665 --> 20:11.505
Yes.

257
20:18.905 --> 20:20.625
General, the fog is rolling in.

258
20:24.465 --> 20:27.305
Sound the drums! Assemble the troops!

259
20:29.825 --> 20:30.905
ZHAO

260
20:57.265 --> 20:58.465
All troops, hear my orders!

261
20:58.545 --> 21:00.505
A thick fog has fallen tonight.

262
21:00.585 --> 21:02.105
It's perfect for a surprise attack.

263
21:02.625 --> 21:04.265
Keep silent and secure your armor.

264
21:04.865 --> 21:06.505
Wrap the horses' hooves to muffle their steps.

265
21:06.585 --> 21:08.385
Follow me into the enemy's royal camp!

266
21:08.465 --> 21:10.185
We'll take the King of Hutuo's head!

267
21:11.145 --> 21:12.825
Kill ten enemy soldiers,

268
21:12.905 --> 21:15.345
and you'll earn a promotion and two bolts of silk!

269
21:16.265 --> 21:17.665
Kill a hundred,

270
21:17.745 --> 21:20.905
and you'll rise three ranks and receive a hundred gold pieces!

271
21:20.985 --> 21:27.945
-Attack! -Attack!

272
21:33.785 --> 21:35.065
Advance!

273
21:51.065 --> 21:52.465
So that's your game, Lu Zhuo.

274
21:52.545 --> 21:57.425
You deliberately spread false intelligence to raid the Hutuo royal camp tonight.

275
22:00.345 --> 22:01.905
General, what do we do?

276
22:03.985 --> 22:05.305
Bring me my horse! Now!

277
22:05.385 --> 22:06.225
Yes! Right away!

278
22:34.385 --> 22:35.945
Go! Hurry!

279
22:40.985 --> 22:43.025
The King of Hutuo fled northwest!

280
22:46.265 --> 22:47.145
Qi Zhongkai.

281
22:48.025 --> 22:50.145
Don't forget our agreement.

282
22:50.225 --> 22:51.865
I've never agreed to betray my country.

283
22:51.945 --> 22:53.385
The Hutuo army must be wiped out!

284
22:53.905 --> 22:56.185
I haven't forgotten the agreement, either.

285
23:02.385 --> 23:03.825
He wants both glory and the woman.

286
23:03.905 --> 23:05.145
His greed knows no bounds.

287
23:05.665 --> 23:07.065
-Stick to the plan. -Yes, sir.

288
23:21.385 --> 23:22.505
Attack!

289
24:18.665 --> 24:19.665
General!

290
24:22.905 --> 24:23.905
General!

291
24:23.985 --> 24:25.625
Deputy General Lu Ya was hunting down the remnants,

292
24:25.705 --> 24:27.305
but ran into Wuzhu, the King of Hutuo's eldest son.

293
24:27.385 --> 24:28.945
He was lured into Iron Scorpion Ridge.

294
24:29.025 --> 24:30.865
He's surrounded, and his fate is unknown!

295
24:30.945 --> 24:32.025
Who gave him permission?

296
24:34.745 --> 24:35.945
General Xiao.

297
24:36.025 --> 24:37.385
Take the prisoners back to camp.

298
24:37.465 --> 24:38.305
I'll go rescue him at Iron Scorpion Ridge.

299
24:38.385 --> 24:39.025
Yes, sir!

300
24:39.105 --> 24:40.185
-Move! -Move!

301
24:40.705 --> 24:41.545
Move out!

302
25:11.905 --> 25:13.145
Lu Zhuo, I…

303
25:13.225 --> 25:14.905
Take mountain trail and retreat, now!

304
25:14.985 --> 25:17.545
I'm not leaving! I'll stay and cover you!

305
25:18.145 --> 25:19.945
Lu Ya! Lu Ya, listen to me.

306
25:20.025 --> 25:21.065
If you don't leave,

307
25:21.145 --> 25:22.945
-neither of us is getting out alive. -I won't!

308
25:23.025 --> 25:25.145
Go! Hurry!

309
25:25.225 --> 25:26.585
Get them all home safely!

310
25:28.465 --> 25:30.425
-Go! Hurry! -Lu Zhuo!

311
25:44.785 --> 25:46.585
You want to kill me, right? Come and get me!

312
25:47.185 --> 25:49.625
Kill Lu Zhuo! Avenge my father!

313
25:50.585 --> 25:51.865
Kill Lu Zhuo!

314
26:10.745 --> 26:11.825
General Qi.

315
26:12.345 --> 26:13.265
I need to get back to the capital with the news.

316
26:15.425 --> 26:16.785
Tie him up.

317
26:21.305 --> 26:22.545
General Qi!

318
26:29.425 --> 26:31.345
Your Ladyship, we've won a great victory.

319
26:31.425 --> 26:33.105
Our army is returning in triumph!

320
27:25.665 --> 27:30.945
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

321
27:42.305 --> 27:43.265
Grandfather.

322
27:44.425 --> 27:46.385
My brother didn't let you down.

323
27:47.025 --> 27:48.545
He won a great victory.

324
27:49.985 --> 27:53.505
But he went back to save me, and got trapped behind enemy lines.

325
27:54.105 --> 27:56.785
He was forced to lead his men straight into a death trap.

326
27:56.865 --> 27:58.185
It's all my fault.

327
27:58.265 --> 27:59.825
I deserve to die, Grandfather!

328
28:05.625 --> 28:06.905
Zhuo!

329
28:07.945 --> 28:09.785
Zhuo!

330
28:10.665 --> 28:12.385
-He's dead. -Oh, Zhuo!

331
28:13.745 --> 28:16.065
-Zhuo! -Zhuo, didn't you promise your mother

332
28:16.145 --> 28:18.625
you'd come home victorious?

333
28:21.465 --> 28:22.505
Lord Lu…

334
28:22.585 --> 28:24.905
Please take Mother with you…

335
28:30.025 --> 28:32.385
Wei Rao. I'm sorry.

336
28:32.945 --> 28:34.385
I couldn't bring him home safely.

337
28:37.945 --> 28:39.065
Where are you going?

338
28:39.145 --> 28:41.105
I know you can't accept this, but you have to.

339
28:41.185 --> 28:43.065
Lu Zhuo is dead. We have to arrange his funeral.

340
28:44.105 --> 28:45.065
You're his wife.

341
28:45.585 --> 28:47.985
No matter how much it hurts, you have to pull yourself together

342
28:49.305 --> 28:51.025
and give him the funeral he deserves.

343
28:57.145 --> 28:58.065
Wei Rao!

344
29:10.265 --> 29:12.745
ZHUYU ESTATE

345
29:14.185 --> 29:15.545
Nothing can bring back the dead.

346
29:15.625 --> 29:16.865
Your Ladyship, my condolences.

347
29:16.945 --> 29:19.025
It's better to cry than bottle it all up.

348
29:19.105 --> 29:20.585
-Xiao. -Your Ladyship.

349
29:20.665 --> 29:22.665
Gather everyone we can mobilize. Now.

350
29:22.745 --> 29:24.665
How many can we assemble before sunset?

351
29:24.745 --> 29:26.265
How many do you need, Your Ladyship?

352
29:26.345 --> 29:28.665
Zhuyu Estate has 800 strongmen and 3000 trained soldiers.

353
29:28.745 --> 29:29.905
If not enough, these two years,

354
29:29.985 --> 29:32.265
thirty thousand drought refugees entered the capital.

355
29:32.345 --> 29:33.905
With frequent outbreaks and earthquakes,

356
29:33.985 --> 29:35.625
refugees poured westward from eastern regions.

357
29:35.705 --> 29:37.385
Eighty thousand around the capital alone.

358
29:37.465 --> 29:39.905
Among them, at thirty thousand are able-bodied young adults.

359
29:40.425 --> 29:41.265
Can we mobilize them?

360
29:42.065 --> 29:43.665
Folk believe you're divine.

361
29:44.185 --> 29:45.625
Only a god could survive the plague

362
29:45.705 --> 29:46.665
and save so many lives.

363
29:46.745 --> 29:48.425
The Emperor may not rally these people.

364
29:48.505 --> 29:50.385
But if you call on them, they'll come.

365
29:50.905 --> 29:52.665
How many troops guard the capital and palace?

366
29:52.745 --> 29:54.545
Those loyal to the Crown Prince and Zheng family

367
29:54.625 --> 29:55.785
number twenty or thirty thousand.

368
30:01.385 --> 30:02.705
Sick and starving refugees…

369
30:03.425 --> 30:05.385
How could they stand against elite cavalry?

370
30:08.025 --> 30:09.945
Prepare 200 carrier pigeons. Write…

371
30:15.105 --> 30:16.025
Your Ladyship.

372
30:17.065 --> 30:17.905
Your Ladyship!

373
30:40.505 --> 30:42.545
Your Ladyship, His Majesty has issued a decree,

374
30:42.625 --> 30:43.945
by exception, letting the general's coffin enter the palace,

375
30:44.025 --> 30:45.265
and have the High Shaman say the rites.

376
30:45.865 --> 30:47.345
Court will be mourning for five days.

377
30:47.425 --> 30:48.865
All officials in mourning clothes for three days.

378
30:49.385 --> 30:50.745
He'll be posthumously honored as the Loyal and Valiant,

379
30:50.825 --> 30:52.385
and buried with the honors of a prince.

380
30:54.385 --> 30:55.345
Understood.

381
31:06.265 --> 31:08.105
Once someone's dead, it's all over.

382
31:09.625 --> 31:11.705
All that's left is an empty shell.

383
31:13.105 --> 31:15.865
What good does wearing mourning clothes and crying do?

384
31:18.705 --> 31:19.545
Leave me.

385
31:22.665 --> 31:23.825
Get out!

386
32:02.305 --> 32:03.225
Your Ladyship.

387
32:03.905 --> 32:05.545
You haven't eaten a thing all day.

388
32:05.625 --> 32:07.585
Please, have a little soup.

389
32:11.025 --> 32:12.705
He gave me this.

390
32:13.905 --> 32:15.865
He picked it out just for me.

391
32:17.025 --> 32:17.985
Your Ladyship…

392
32:23.145 --> 32:24.625
As long as Lu Zhuo was alive,

393
32:26.265 --> 32:28.745
they were terrified of him.

394
32:34.825 --> 32:36.585
But now he's dead.

395
32:40.425 --> 32:41.825
He's dead.

396
32:50.185 --> 32:51.785
I won't let them get away with this.

397
32:53.545 --> 32:55.425
Those who hurt Lu Zhuo…

398
32:55.505 --> 32:57.985
I won't let them celebrate! Never!

399
33:04.985 --> 33:05.945
Aman.

400
33:08.265 --> 33:09.625
Help me get dressed.

401
33:16.745 --> 33:18.705
Lu Zhuo is dead?

402
33:19.545 --> 33:21.545
He's really gone?

403
33:23.145 --> 33:23.985
Good.

404
33:25.225 --> 33:26.825
Very good!

405
33:28.265 --> 33:29.545
Word has come from the palace.

406
33:29.625 --> 33:32.665
His Majesty was so distraught that he coughed up blood and passed out.

407
33:33.265 --> 33:34.385
The palace is in chaos.

408
33:35.145 --> 33:36.265
Your Highness.

409
33:36.345 --> 33:38.305
We must act tonight. There's no time to lose.

410
33:38.385 --> 33:39.905
I'll take the palace gates.

411
33:39.985 --> 33:41.785
Your Highness, lead your men into the inner palace.

412
33:41.865 --> 33:43.185
Grand Commandant Zheng will secure the city gates.

413
33:43.265 --> 33:45.225
By the time everyone wakes at dawn,

414
33:47.225 --> 33:48.585
it'll all be over.

415
33:55.625 --> 33:57.745
Your Highness, shall we march on the palace now?

416
33:57.825 --> 33:58.985
No.

417
34:01.985 --> 34:03.865
I'll personally lead my guards

418
34:04.945 --> 34:07.665
to kill the traitors at His Majesty's side first.

419
34:09.665 --> 34:12.465
I'll accompany Your Highness to Zhuyu Estate.

420
34:12.545 --> 34:14.425
Use Wei Rao's head as our war offering.

421
34:14.505 --> 34:16.225
That'll send morale soaring.

422
34:40.865 --> 34:42.465
Your Highness, we've searched everywhere.

423
34:42.545 --> 34:45.264
There's not a soul here. Lady Wu'an is nowhere to be found, either.

424
34:45.344 --> 34:46.585
Words must have gotten out.

425
34:46.665 --> 34:47.985
That's why Wei Rao escaped.

426
34:49.824 --> 34:51.025
Those people…

427
34:51.105 --> 34:52.505
are long gone into the mountains.

428
34:52.585 --> 34:53.505
Your Highness.

429
34:56.705 --> 34:57.585
Something's wrong.

430
34:57.665 --> 34:59.385
Quick! Get to the palace! Now!

431
35:07.905 --> 35:10.505
HENGCHENG GATE

432
35:24.065 --> 35:26.425
HENGCHENG GATE

433
35:26.505 --> 35:29.785
PRINCE JING'S RESIDENCE

434
35:35.465 --> 35:38.585
Your Highness. I've been ordered to escort you.

435
35:39.225 --> 35:41.785
Ordered? By whom?

436
35:41.865 --> 35:43.985
Are you part of this rebellion, too?

437
35:44.065 --> 35:45.865
Your Highness. Please come with us.

438
35:56.945 --> 35:59.265
I'll go with you. Leave the women out of this.

439
35:59.945 --> 36:02.225
Orders are orders. Forgive my disrespect.

440
36:02.825 --> 36:05.545
Take everyone into custody!

441
36:08.065 --> 36:08.905
This way, Your Highness.

442
36:23.825 --> 36:24.905
Unrest is coming to the city.

443
36:24.985 --> 36:26.385
What should I do?

444
36:27.265 --> 36:29.705
Hidden rocks lie beneath the deep currents.

445
36:29.785 --> 36:31.505
And danger lurks beyond the path to safety.

446
36:32.665 --> 36:33.865
The omen says a trapped dragon.

447
36:35.785 --> 36:37.665
The Crown Prince has marched into the palace.

448
36:38.185 --> 36:41.305
If he takes the throne, we'll lose everything we've worked for!

449
36:42.345 --> 36:43.665
Fate is what we make of it.

450
36:44.745 --> 36:46.705
Maybe I shouldn't trust your readings.

451
36:48.785 --> 36:50.465
A dragon waits beneath the waters,

452
36:50.545 --> 36:51.905
ready to rise when the time is right.

453
36:52.425 --> 36:54.585
Your Highness, please be patient.

454
37:00.265 --> 37:01.665
You're right, my dear.

455
37:02.825 --> 37:04.545
Gather our men first.

456
37:05.425 --> 37:07.225
I'll back whoever wins.

457
37:30.465 --> 37:32.065
XUANSHI PALACE

458
37:37.505 --> 37:39.025
I heard my father was unwell.

459
37:39.625 --> 37:40.905
I've come to check on him.

460
37:40.985 --> 37:42.705
Go inside and inform him.

461
37:42.785 --> 37:46.065
If Father condemns that wicked consort and her two children to death,

462
37:46.145 --> 37:48.705
not a single soldier I've brought will dare enter and disturb him.

463
37:53.225 --> 37:54.985
Your Highness. The victors take the throne.

464
37:55.065 --> 37:56.145
The losers pay the price.

465
37:56.705 --> 37:58.065
There's no turning back now.

466
37:58.145 --> 37:59.665
We've come this far.

467
38:00.185 --> 38:01.785
Why not storm the palace?

468
38:03.265 --> 38:04.745
You're just a woman.

469
38:05.265 --> 38:06.465
What do you know?

470
38:06.545 --> 38:08.825
I'm the rightful heir, not some treasonous rebel!

471
38:08.905 --> 38:10.425
My father is old and sick.

472
38:10.505 --> 38:12.305
He can't live forever, can he?

473
38:12.825 --> 38:14.705
Once I secure the sealed abdication edict,

474
38:14.785 --> 38:16.505
I'll be the rightful new emperor.

475
38:16.585 --> 38:18.345
The court officials, the common people,

476
38:18.425 --> 38:21.665
and the feudal lords will swear me their willing loyalty.

477
38:23.145 --> 38:24.425
Forgive my ignorance.

478
38:26.785 --> 38:29.065
A wise man knows when to yield.

479
38:29.145 --> 38:31.305
Father will make the right choice.

480
38:32.185 --> 38:33.625
You raise an army in rebellion

481
38:33.705 --> 38:35.865
and still expect the realm to loyally submit to you?

482
38:36.385 --> 38:38.105
Absurdly foolish.

483
38:38.625 --> 38:39.825
If it were me…

484
40:53.585 --> 40:56.745
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
